{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "magical-girl-s-oath",
  "name": "Magical Girl's Oath",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Magical_Girl%27s_Oath",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-11T05:51:38.089Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Employer (Party A): Magical Girl Troupe (MGT)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Familiar (name)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pledger (Party B):"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In accordance with the relevant regulations of Planarcadia, Parties A and B, on the basis of equality and voluntary consent, have reached the following agreement regarding the employment of magical girls:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Clause 1: Basic Details"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• During the duration of the oath, the pledger must complete magical girl activities for a total of system hours."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As the compensation of the oath, the pledger shall receive the following remuneration:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Basic salary of credits"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Reasonable reimbursement incurred from the activities"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Rewards based on performance"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Clause 2: Responsibilities of the Pledger"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "During the duration of the oath, the pledger must conduct activities according to the troupe's guidance and abide by the following regulations:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• The pledger must respond to emergency mobilization requests irregularly."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• To avoid the loss of public property, when launching attack-based magic, the average power of the impact must be controlled within 500,000 Aidens."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Before the oath ends, the pledger must avoid any unnecessary emotional development to reduce the possible effects of \"Moral Darkening.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• The pledger is usually not required to transform and conceal their real identity, unless explicitly stated."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Clause 3: Obligations of the Employer"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "During the duration of the oath, the employer must support the pledger's activities within reasonable means, which includes but is not limited to:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Providing the pledger with Magic abilities customized to their personalities."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "※ For non-combat ability users, additional general equipment must be provided."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Sharing battle details and information with the pledger, and providing battle reinforcement."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Reimbursing the pledger's medical costs incurred from injuries sustained during their activities. (Maximum cost cannot exceed credits)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Regularly planning idol events required for obtaining Wishpower, and providing the necessary venues, facilities, advertisements, and more."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Clause 17: Nurturing Responsibilities"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The pledger is obligated to nurture their familiar by providing them with the necessary Wishpower and emotional support required for survival."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "※ This clause is not restricted to the duration of the oath and may be extended or shortened based on actual circumstances."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Clause 18: Other Contract Matters"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Unless otherwise stated, both parties will abide by the following information in the duration of the oath:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Both parties will acquire permission from the Security Bureau to browse the database, but are obliged to maintain confidentiality."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Both parties will not commit any acts that will harm the reputation of the individuals or the troupe."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "• Both parties can start live streams and promotional events. The Wishpower obtained from the events will be distributed based on negotiation between the two parties."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Please copy the following oath (Required to be handwritten. If you do not have hands, you may substitute this with a video):"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "From this day forth, I shall inherit the mantle of the Magical Girl and swear this oath—"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Under the guidance of the Troupe, I shall maintain peace within the region and take a stand against the forces of evil."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In my leisure time, I will participate in the Troupe's idol performances to provide Wishpower for my familiar."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the face of sorrow and pain, I will no longer waver or hesitate."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": []
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This oath will take effect after both parties have signed or stamped it. There are three copies of this oath and its attachments, of which two will be provided to Party A, and one will be given to Party B."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Any disputes over this oath must be resolved with negotiation between the two parties, and cannot apply for arbitration from the Security Bureau."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Employer (Party A) Signature/Stamp/Pawprint: Magical Girl Troupe (MGT)"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pledger (Party B) Signature/Stamp:"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<!--"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
